00:36:50.970 --> 00:36:54.805
[NOISE] Um, and so,

00:36:54.805 --> 00:36:57.625
I guess, one of the interesting things that this shows is that, uh,

00:36:57.625 --> 00:36:59.890
there does exist a representation under which

00:36:59.890 --> 00:37:02.425
